WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:06.560
SCP-035 VS SCP-1000. Could the boundlessly&nbsp;
malevolent Possessive Mask fend off against&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:12.160
a specimen of SCP-1000, aka Bigfoot, a&nbsp;
large and extremely advanced race of apes?

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:17.600
SCP-1000 in their prime is undeniably more&nbsp;
powerful than a single human. These giant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:22.400
nocturnal apes have both impressive physical&nbsp;
strength, as well as intelligence and wisdom great&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:27.120
enough to build hyper-advanced societies while&nbsp;
humans were still killing each other with rocks.

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:32.080
However, seeing as the brainwaves of SCP-1000&nbsp;
don’t differ that greatly from humans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:36.000
it wouldn’t be a stretch for the mask to&nbsp;
manipulate one of them into putting it on.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.320
A single SCP-1000 specimen would be&nbsp;
no match for the terrifying SCP-035

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:45.040
When the mask goes on, it’s curtains.

